Package: syn-approvals
Version: 0.1.0~alpha1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Syn maintainers <security@syn-approvals.invalid>
Depends: sudo (>= 1.9.17), libpam0g (>= 0.99.7.1), libc6 (>= 2.39), libgcc-s1 (>= 4.2), iproute2
Description: human approval gate for remote sudo invocations
 Syn stages a classic sudo approval plug-in, an unprivileged relay, and
 recovery tooling. The package does not create a NOPASSWD rule; an
 administrator must complete pairing and run synctl install explicitly.
